f)Linear Gradient - Using Angles

A value of 0deg is equivalent to "to top".
A value of 90deg is equivalent to "to right".
A value of 180deg is equivalent to "to bottom".
A value of 270deg equivalent to "to left"

Quick Conversion Table
Angle	Normalized	Equivalent To
0deg	0°	to top
90deg	90°	to right
180deg	180°	to bottom
270deg	270°	to left
360deg	0°	to top
-90deg	270°	to right
-180deg	180°	to bottom
-270deg	90°	to right


